    <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "Proposed test with existing data: Extract quantitative shape descriptors for siliceous sponge and calcitic holothurian spicules and test convergence after controlling for developmental compartment geometry. Similar shapes across materials support material-independence only if within-material and cell-confinement alternatives are modeled.";
